# The walker, facing right: four frames of 16x32. The near leg is blue (4) and the
# far one grey (8), so the two strides are visibly different frames. Arms swing
# out on a stride and hang at the sides on a pass.

# frame 0: stride, near leg forward
@sprite art_walk0 16x32
